"releaseNotes":"Welcome to Everyday Grids: Logic Puzzles!\nYour daily brain workout starts here — clever mini-games, fresh puzzles every day, and rewarding streaks to keep you coming back. Start solving now!\n– Team Fanatee", "version":"1.2.0", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Everyday Grids: Logic Puzzles\n\nA fun daily brain boost — no pressure, just pure logic\n\nLooking for a quick brain workout that actually feels good to play?\nEveryday Grids is your daily dose of smart fun — packed with short, clever logic puzzles that keep your mind active without the stress.\n\nFrom the creators of Everyday Puzzles, this new experience is all about logic — no words, no guesswork. Just satisfying challenges that help sharpen your focus, memory, and problem-solving skills. \n\nPacked with clever mini-games, daily challenges, and streak-based rewards, it's your perfect go-to for smart, relaxing gameplay.\nPlay it while you sip your coffee, take a break, or wind down.  A chill, satisfying way to give your brain a daily workout. \n\nUnique Mini-Games – 1 Brilliant Puzzle Hub\nEvery day brings a fresh set of puzzles designed to stretch your thinking in fun, bite-sized ways.\nEach puzzle mode brings its own twist, charm, and logic challenge. \n\n\nLotus\nInspired by Star Battle and Queens puzzles. Place one Lotus Flower in each color zone — no overlaps. Clean, strategic, and super satisfying.\n\nPanda\nMatch each panda to its bamboo in this playful twist on Tents and Trees. Light-hearted logic at its finest.\n\nLibra\nBalance Fire and Ice icons evenly across the grid. Inspired by clever games like Binairo and Tango.\n\nZip\nTrace a single path across the entire grid, visiting every cell. A satisfying journey where every step matters and every seed blossoms into a flower.\n\nSums\nFill the grid so every row, column, and color region hits the right total. A number-crunching challenge that adds up to pure fun.\n\nHashi\nLink each sushi by building connections based on their numbers. A tasty twist on the classic Bridges that link the whole grid together.\n\n\nNew Puzzles Every Day\nPlay a fresh puzzle in each game mode daily! Solve them to:\n-Keep your streak alive\n-Unlock rewards and achievements\n-Track your progress and grow your skills\n\nMissed a day? No sweat — use the calendar to catch up anytime.\n\nEven More Features to Unlock\nMissions\nComplete events and earn XP to unlock special puzzle badges.\n\nXP Levels\nLevel up by earning XP as you play. The more you solve, the more you earn!\n\nBadges\nCollect unique badges from events and challenges to show off your puzzle skills.\n\nVIP Membership\nGo VIP to play ad-free and get access to exclusive perks and extras.\n\nWhy You’ll Love Everyday Grids:\n-Addictive logic puzzles you can play every day\n-Unique puzzle types — more coming soon!\n-Fun, focused gameplay that fits your schedule\n-Daily streaks, XP, and rewards to chase\n-Free to play — no pressure, just good vibes\n\nFrom the Makers of Fan Favorites\nCreated by Fanatee, the team behind CodyCross, Everyday Puzzles, Word Lanes, LunaCross, Stop, and Stop 2.\nIf you love brain games, this one’s for you.\n\nDownload Everyday Grids: Logic Puzzles now\nJump into the puzzle party, keep your streak going, and give your brain a daily treat — one clever grid at a time.", "userRatingCount":848}, 
