"description":"Tap, guide, and unwind with flowing sand.\n\nDive into a calming puzzle experience where every tap controls the movement of colorful sand. Send containers along a moving belt, gather grains by color, and watch images slowly appear as the sand cascades with smooth, lifelike physics. Easy to start, satisfying to master — each level delivers a relaxing yet engaging challenge.\n\nEnjoy the soothing visuals of falling sand, responsive tap mechanics, and progressively evolving gameplay. Whether you’re looking to relax your mind or perfect your timing and strategy, this experience blends mindful play with rewarding puzzle progression.\n\nFeatures\n- Intuitive tap-based sand collection mechanics\n- Conveyor-style movement and timing gameplay\n- Match sand colors to reveal vibrant artworks\n- Smooth, realistic physics simulation\n- Increasing difficulty with new obstacles\n- Polished animations and calming atmosphere\n- Dozens of unique pictures to uncover\n- Relaxing and addictive gameplay suitable for everyone", "userRatingCount":9265}, 
