"description":"Memory Games with Animals is a fun memory training game featuring over 290 graphics and cute sounds. This game will keep your kids entertained in the car, in a restaurant, or anywhere else. It helps train their memory and improve their recognition skills while they have fun.\n\nInitially, all the memory cards will be face down. Select two cards by tapping on them. If the cards don't match, they will be turned face down again. Remember what's on the cards so you can find all the matching pairs.\n\nYou can adjust the game's difficulty by choosing boards of different sizes (3x4, 4x5, or 5x6).\n\nCARD CATEGORIES\n\n• Animals\n• Dinosaurs\n• Fish\n• Birds\n• Fruits and Vegetables\n• Dogs\n• Bugs\n• Numbers\n\nSome of these categories are available through In-App Purchase.\n\nMAIN FEATURES\n\n• Three levels of difficulty: Easy, Normal and Hard\n• Over 290 different card images\n• 8 categories to choose from\n• Easy-to-use interface\n• Sound effects (can be turned on or off)\n• No Ads\n• Game Center Support. Global leaderboards showing most wins\n• Universal App, full native support for iPhone and iPad", "userRatingCount":1838}]
